{"ID":"20240206110147-duew2mc","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240206110147-duew2mc","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206110147-duew2mc\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206110157-bvj0ueu\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240611170311-9kpa60i\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:2766,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240625135036-ndp20wg\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:8,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:8\u0026#125;","title":"193泽兰","type":"doc","updated":"20240820140533"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206110157-bvj0ueu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206110157-bvj0ueu","updated":"20240206110201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产于江苏、浙江、安徽等地区。\n【性状】\t本品茎呈方柱形，少分枝，四面均有浅纵沟，表面黄绿色或带紫色，节处紫色明显，有白色茸毛；质脆，断面黄白色，髓部中空。叶对生，有短柄或近无柄；叶片多皱缩，展平后呈披针形或长圆形。上表面黑绿色或暗绿色，下表面灰绿色，密具腺点，两面均有短毛；先端尖.基部渐狭，边缘有锯齿。轮伞花序腋生，花冠多脱落，苞片和花萼宿存，小包片披针形，有缘毛，花萼钟形，5齿。气微，味淡。\n【性味】\t苦、辛，微温。\n【功效】\t活血调经，祛瘀消痈，利水消肿。用于月经不调，经闭，痛经，产后瘀血腹痛，疮痈肿毒，水肿腹水。"}]},{"ID":"20240206110150-kqafzrg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206110150-kqafzrg","updated":"20240206110150"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206110150-32a07yw.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]}]},{"ID":"20240625134019-n04drpw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240625134019-n04drpw","updated":"20240820115750"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 424px;","style":"width: 414px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"泽兰1"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/泽兰1-20240625134039-29r0e0t.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 414px;\" parent-style=\"width: 424px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240619173317-8l0hzf0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240619173317-8l0hzf0","updated":"20240820115933"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 460px;","style":"width: 450px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"泽兰"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/泽兰-20240619173317-2sb3vsv.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 450px;\" parent-style=\"width: 460px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 458px;","style":"width: 448px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"海藻 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/海藻 5-20240820115855-v3u6jdy.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 448px;\" parent-style=\"width: 458px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 344px;","style":"width: 334px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"海藻 (6)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/海藻 6-20240820115933-mz5d0fq.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 334px;\" parent-style=\"width: 344px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240820115855-dvid0pt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240820115855-dvid0pt","updated":"20240820140508"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 594px;","style":"width: 584px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"泽兰 (7)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/泽兰 7-20240820140101-8myiv75.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 584px;\" parent-style=\"width: 594px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 628px;","style":"width: 618px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"泽兰 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/泽兰 1-20240820135217-elgkwxs.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 618px;\" parent-style=\"width: 628px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240820140521-9px5k7m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240820140521-9px5k7m","updated":"20240820140524"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 353px;","style":"width: 343px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"泽兰 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/泽兰 4-20240820135522-qfkkqh6.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 343px;\" parent-style=\"width: 353px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 313px;","style":"width: 303px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"泽兰 (10)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/泽兰 10-20240820140414-hp8jr4z.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 303px;\" parent-style=\"width: 313px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 263px;","style":"width: 253px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"泽兰6"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/泽兰6-20240625140430-f0lh719.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 253px;\" parent-style=\"width: 263px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 284px;","style":"width: 274px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"泽兰"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/泽兰-20240820121213-ufzz86s.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 274px;\" parent-style=\"width: 284px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240820140533-8xa4lpk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240820140533-8xa4lpk","updated":"20240820140533"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 614px;","style":"width: 604px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"泽兰 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/泽兰 2-20240820135309-8ozip7d.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 604px;\" parent-style=\"width: 614px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 621px;","style":"width: 611px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"泽兰 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/泽兰 3-20240820135433-31sdif9.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 611px;\" parent-style=\"width: 621px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240820140205-vlje7km","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240820140205-vlje7km","updated":"20240820140253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 609px;","style":"width: 599px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"泽兰 (8)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/泽兰 8-20240820140205-swnusdd.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 599px;\" parent-style=\"width: 609px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"泽兰 (9)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/泽兰 9-20240820140253-s58b9ut.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240820135736-svtzdpb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240820135736-svtzdpb","updated":"20240820135843"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 557px;","style":"width: 547px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"泽兰 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/泽兰 5-20240820135736-1oq66dj.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 547px;\" parent-style=\"width: 557px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"泽兰 (6)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/泽兰 6-20240820135843-n2dlk0f.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240625135530-a2zpwtw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240625135530-a2zpwtw","updated":"20240625140002"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：泽兰跟地笋极相似，两者对比，泽兰茎上有硬毛。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170915-84f5r02","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611170915-84f5r02"}},{"ID":"20240611170917-ffdcdnd","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611170917-ffdcdnd","updated":"20240611170924"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"泽兰《证类本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240611170917-xphao0s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170917-xphao0s","updated":"20240611170917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦、甘，微温，无毒。主乳妇内衄，中风余疾，大腹水肿，身面四肢浮肿，骨节中水，金疮，痈肿疮脓，产后金疮内塞。一名虎兰，一名龙枣，一名虎蒲。生汝南诸大泽旁。三月三日采，阴干。（防己为之使。）"}]},{"ID":"20240611170917-7l5vcxz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170917-7l5vcxz","updated":"20240611170917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陶隐居云∶今处处有，多生下湿地。叶微香，可煎油。或生泽旁，故名泽兰，亦名都梁香，可作浴汤。人家多种之而叶小异。今山中又有一种甚相似，茎方，叶小强，不甚香。既云泽兰又生泽旁，故山中者为非，而药家乃采用之。唐本注云∶泽兰，茎方，节紫色，叶似兰草而不香，今京下用之者是。陶云都梁香，乃兰草尔。俗名兰香，煮以洗浴，亦生泽畔，人家种之，花白紫萼，茎圆，殊非泽兰也。陶注兰草，复云名都梁香，并不深识也。臣禹锡等谨按吴氏云∶泽兰一名水香。神农、黄帝、歧伯、桐君∶酸，无毒。季氏∶温。生下地水旁，叶如兰，二月生香，赤节，四叶相值枝节间。药性论云∶泽兰，使，味苦、辛。主产后腹痛，频产血气衰冷，成劳瘦羸，又治通身面目大肿。主妇人血沥，腰痛，日华子泽兰，通九窍，利关脉，养血气，破宿血，消症瘕，产前产后百病，通小肠，长肉生肌，消扑损瘀血，治鼻洪吐血，头风目痛，妇人劳瘦，丈夫面黄。四月、五月采，作缠把子。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170917-z1523l0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170917-z1523l0","updated":"20240611170917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"图经曰∶泽兰，生汝南诸大泽旁，今荆、徐、随、寿、蜀、梧州，河中府皆有之。根紫黑色，如粟根。二月生苗，高二、三尺，茎秆青紫色，作四棱。叶生相对，如薄荷，微香。七月开花，带紫白色，萼通紫色，亦似薄荷花。三月采苗，阴干。荆、湖、岭南人家多种之。寿州出者无花子。此与兰草大抵相类，但兰草生水旁，叶光润，阴小紫，五、六月盛。而泽兰生水泽中及下湿地，叶尖，微有毛，不光润，方茎紫节，七月、八月初采，微辛，此为异耳。今妇人方中最急用也。又有一种马兰，生水泽旁，颇似泽兰，而气臭，味辛。亦主破血，补金创，断下血。陈藏器以为《楚词》所喻恶草即是也。北人呼为紫菊，以其花似菊也。又有一种山兰，生山侧，似刘寄奴，叶无桠，不对生，花心微黄赤。亦能破血，皆可用。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170917-or44uwp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170917-or44uwp","updated":"20240611170917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雷公云∶凡使，须要别识雄雌，其形不同。大泽兰形叶皆圆，根青黄，能生血调气与荣合。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170917-vogs4e1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170917-vogs4e1","updated":"20240611170917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小泽兰回别，采得后，看叶上斑，根须尖，此药能破血，通久积。凡修事，大小泽兰须细锉之。用绢袋盛，悬于屋南畔角上，令干用。子母秘录∶治小儿蓐疮，嚼泽兰心封上。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170917-lmyhx03","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170917-lmyhx03","updated":"20240611170917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"衍义曰∶泽兰，按《补注》云∶叶如兰。今兰叶如麦门冬，稍阔而长，及一、二尺无枝梗，殊不与泽兰相似。泽兰才出土便分枝，梗叶如菊，但尖长。若取香嗅，则稍相类。既谓之泽兰。又曰生汝南大泽旁，则其种本别。如兰之说误矣。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170738-65zfka3","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611170738-65zfka3"}},{"ID":"20240611170857-xqlo7d7","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611170857-xqlo7d7","updated":"20240611170901"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"泽兰《本草经集注》"}]},{"ID":"20240611170857-fv67iui","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170857-fv67iui","updated":"20240611170857"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦、甘，微温，无毒。主治乳妇内衄，中风余疾，大腹水肿，身、面、四肢浮肿，节中水，金疮，痈肿疮脓。产后金疮内塞。一名虎兰，一名龙枣，一名虎蒲。生汝南诸大泽傍，三月三日采，阴干。（防己为之使。）"}]},{"ID":"20240611170857-o3d2sxj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170857-o3d2sxj","updated":"20240611170857"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"今处处有，多生下湿地。叶微香，可煎油，或生泽傍，故名泽兰，亦名都梁香，可作浴汤。人家多种之，而叶小异。今山中又有一种甚相似，茎方，叶小强，不甚香。既云泽兰，又生泽傍，故山中者为非，而药家乃采用之。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170815-48zie7e","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611170815-48zie7e"}},{"ID":"20240611170845-gxm15fa","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611170845-gxm15fa","updated":"20240611170845"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"泽兰"}]},{"ID":"20240611170845-fr7ilcn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170845-fr7ilcn","updated":"20240611170845"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦、甘，微温，无毒。主治乳妇内衄，中风余疾，大腹水肿，身、面、四肢浮肿，节中水，金疮，痈肿疮脓。产后金疮内塞。一名虎兰，一名龙枣，一名虎蒲。生汝南诸大泽傍，三月三日采，阴干。（防己为之使。）"}]},{"ID":"20240611170845-c4mnjqk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170845-c4mnjqk","updated":"20240611170845"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"今处处有，多生下湿地。叶微香，可煎油，或生泽傍，故名泽兰，亦名都梁香，可作浴汤。人家多种之，而叶小异。今山中又有一种甚相似，茎方，叶小强，不甚香。既云泽兰，又生泽傍，故山中者为非，而药家乃采用之。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170816-443t9xe","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611170816-443t9xe"}},{"ID":"20240611170836-biiet2h","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611170836-biiet2h","updated":"20240611170839"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"泽兰《得配本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240611170836-t476qll","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170836-t476qll","updated":"20240611170836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"亦名孩儿菊"}]},{"ID":"20240611170836-3w47uz1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170836-3w47uz1","updated":"20240611170836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"防己为之使。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170836-8ttmeaf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170836-8ttmeaf","updated":"20240611170836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苦、辛、温。入足厥阴，兼足太阴经血分。破宿血，去症瘕，兼除痰癖、蛊虫，能疗目痛痈肿。配防己，治产后水肿。配当归，治月水不利。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170836-y1sm0px","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170836-y1sm0px","updated":"20240611170836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"煎汤熏洗产后阴户燥热，遂成翻花。（再加枯矾煎洗之即安。）"}]},{"ID":"20240611170836-h6st5fu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170836-h6st5fu","updated":"20240611170836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"根名地笋，主治同。血虚枯秘者禁用。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170836-nky2y2t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170836-nky2y2t","updated":"20240611170836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"怪症∶忽然疼痛，或遍身疼痛异常，名鬼箭风。用泽兰一两，桃仁三十粒，酒水各半煎服。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170816-uyu8awb","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611170816-uyu8awb"}},{"ID":"20240611170817-vi5ve35","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611170817-vi5ve35","updated":"20240611170821"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"泽兰《神农本草经赞》"}]},{"ID":"20240611170817-ahd3u2c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170817-ahd3u2c","updated":"20240611170817"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦微温。主乳妇内衄。中风余疾。大腹水肿。身面四肢浮肿。骨节中水。金创。痈肿。创脓。一名虎兰。一名龙枣。生大泽傍。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170817-xc44h5w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170817-xc44h5w","updated":"20240611170817"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"猗猗兰霭。秋发幽香。南陔叶并。九畹茎方。遗思纫佩。具浴汤。窃名荪芷。引类都梁。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170817-z19ke3v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170817-z19ke3v","updated":"20240611170817"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"嵇康诗。猗猗兰霭。苏颂曰。七月开花紫白色。束晰诗。循彼南陔。言采其兰。吴普曰。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170817-ddqxn87","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170817-ddqxn87","updated":"20240611170817"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"二月生苗。赤节。四叶相值。苏恭曰。茎方节紫。离骚。纫秋兰以为佩。又。余既滋兰之九畹兮。九歌。浴兰汤兮沐芳。又。折芳馨兮遗所思。礼。三日则汤请浴。遁斋闲览。楚辞所咏之兰。或以为猗兰。或以为都梁香。当以泽兰为止。杨慎序。人家盆植如蒲萱者。兰之别种。曰荪与芷耳。九畹之受诬。千载矣。尔雅翼。今之兰草都梁香也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170738-2cihl67","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611170738-2cihl67"}},{"ID":"20240611170804-pdtb256","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611170804-pdtb256","updated":"20240611170808"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"泽兰《冯氏锦囊秘录》"}]},{"ID":"20240611170804-zmk3mmq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170804-zmk3mmq","updated":"20240611170804"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"感土泽之气，故味苦甘而入血，兼得乎春气，故微湿而无毒，为妇人产后百病、血涩腰痛、血气衰冷、成劳羸囊，或为面浮肿泄热，和血行而带补之要药。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170804-db11lbl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170804-db11lbl","updated":"20240611170804"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"泽兰，理胎产百病淹缠，消身面四肢湿肿，破宿血去 瘕行瘀血，疗扑损，散头风目痛，追痈肿疮脓，长肉生肌，总皆行血和血，行中带补之功也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170804-h4pg5zi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170804-h4pg5zi","updated":"20240611170804"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主治（痘疹合参） 妇人产后，恶露未尽者，痘中亦用之。感土泽之气，入血海而消瘀，行中带补，气味平和。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170738-5ryq3tn","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611170738-5ryq3tn"}},{"ID":"20240611170739-6nczaej","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611170739-6nczaej","updated":"20240611170746"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"泽兰《滇南本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240611170739-z89647k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170739-z89647k","updated":"20240611170741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"泽兰"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，一名红梗草。味苦、辛，性微温。入肝、肾二经。行血，破瘀，治腹痛。并攻痈疽疮毒、排脓，跌打损伤，一切瘀血；且用以通经。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170739-qr1z30e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170739-qr1z30e","updated":"20240611170739"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"泽兰，一名红秆草。生有水处，绿叶红秆，高二、三尺许，软枝。感土泽之气，故味苦、甘而入血分，兼得春气，故微温。无毒。主治身面、四肢湿气肿，破瘀血，去症瘕，散头风，行血。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170653-lucijks","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611170653-lucijks"}},{"ID":"20240611170715-lax1wys","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611170715-lax1wys","updated":"20240611170720"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"泽兰《玉楸药解》"}]},{"ID":"20240611170715-jj567j2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170715-jj567j2","updated":"20240611170715"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦，微温，入足厥阴肝经。通经活血，破滞磨坚，胎产俱良，瘕癥颇善，止腰腹疼痛，消痈疽热肿，扑打吐衄能瘳。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170715-q971vpn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170715-q971vpn","updated":"20240611170715"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"泽兰辛温香散，行血破瘀，通脉安胎，一切痈疽癥瘕、金疮扑打、吐衄诸证皆医。而气味和平，不伤迅利，行经化结之良品也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170653-itsc4rs","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611170653-itsc4rs"}},{"ID":"20240611170704-kks8wz3","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611170704-kks8wz3","updated":"20240611170710"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"泽兰《本经逢原》"}]},{"ID":"20240611170704-2n9qyyt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170704-2n9qyyt","updated":"20240611170704"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苦甘微温，无毒。取叶，酒洗之。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170704-32dlvkw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170704-32dlvkw","updated":"20240611170704"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》主金疮痈肿疮脓。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170704-d09jshs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170704-d09jshs","updated":"20240611170704"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"发明"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"泽兰入足太阴、厥阴血分，专治产后血败流于腰股，拘挛疼痛，破宿血，消症瘕，除水肿、身面四肢浮肿。《本经》主金疮、痈肿，疮脓，皆取散血之功，为产科要药也。更以芎、归、童便佐之，功效胜于益母。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170653-lxg9gfa","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611170653-lxg9gfa"}},{"ID":"20240611170654-zir4yv6","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611170654-zir4yv6","updated":"20240611170659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"泽兰《本草求真》"}]},{"ID":"20240611170654-uba31xe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170654-uba31xe","updated":"20240611170654"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（芳草）兰草入气利水除痰 泽兰入肝脾行水和血"}]},{"ID":"20240611170654-axuxoio","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170654-axuxoio","updated":"20240611170654"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"泽兰（专入肝脾）。苦甘而辛。即今妇人采置发中除垢者是也。玩书所论泽兰。与本经兰草同为一类。其生泽旁。紫茎素枝。赤节绿叶。对节生有细齿。但兰草则茎圆节长。叶光有岐。泽兰则茎微节方。短叶有毛之为异耳。二物并于嫩时皆可刈佩。以其花叶皆香。置于发中。能以辟垢省头。故虽呼为香草。俗则呼为孩儿菊。与于山兰。其花虽香。而叶绝无气者。迥不相同。（时珍曰。兰草泽兰。一类二种。虽生水旁下湿处。但以茎圆节长。而叶光有岐者。为兰草。茎微方节短。而叶有毛者为泽兰。朱文公离骚辨证云。必花叶俱香。燥湿不变。方可刈佩。今之兰蕙花虽香。而叶无气。质弱易萎。不可刈佩。汪昂曰。本经既言泽兰。则非山兰明矣。是离骚之秋兰。当属本经之泽兰无疑也。吴草芦曰。兰为医经上品之药。有枝有茎。今所谓兰无枝无茎。因黄山谷称之。遂谬指为《离骚》之兰耳。）兰草茎圆叶光。其性专主入气。虽书载有久服益气。轻身不老肤语。然究止属利水除痰。杀蛊辟恶。而为消渴良药。即内经所谓数食肥甘。传为消渴。治之以兰。以除陈气是也。（东垣治消渴生津饮。用兰叶。盖本于此。又此草浸油涂发。去风垢。令香润。史记所谓罗襦襟解。微闻香泽者是也。）泽兰茎方叶毛。虽书载有和血舒脾。长养肌肉之妙。然究皆属入脾行水。入肝治血之味。是以九窍能通。关节能利。宿食能破。月经能调。症瘕能消。水肿能散。产后血淋腰痛能止。吐血衄血。目痛风瘫。痈毒扑损能治。（时珍曰。兰草泽兰。气香而温。味辛而散。阴中之阳。足太阴厥阴经药也。脾喜芳香。肝宜辛散。脾气舒。则三焦通利而正气和。肝郁散。则营卫流行而病邪解。兰草走气道。泽兰走血分。正如赤白茯苓芍药。补泻皆不同也。）"}]},{"ID":"20240611170654-8hk7nyk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170654-8hk7nyk","updated":"20240611170654"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"观此则书所云舒脾和血。不过因其水消血除之意。岂真舒脾和血之味也乎？入补气补血之味同投。则消中有补。不致损真。诚佳品也。防己为使。（根名地笋。）"}]},{"ID":"20240611170556-i15ye9d","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611170556-i15ye9d"}},{"ID":"20240611170638-dw2f3vf","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611170638-dw2f3vf","updated":"20240611170644"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"泽兰《新修本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240611170638-p7pd17w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170638-p7pd17w","updated":"20240611170638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦、甘，微温，无毒。主乳妇内衄，中风余疾，大腹水肿，身面四肢浮肿，骨节中水，金疮痈肿疮脓。产后金疮内塞。一名虎兰，一名龙枣，一名虎蒲。生汝南诸大泽旁，三月三日采，阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170638-tjlnxna","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170638-tjlnxna","updated":"20240611170638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"防己为之使。今处处有，多生下湿地。叶微香，可煎油，或生泽旁，故名泽兰，亦名都梁香，可作浴汤。人家多种之，而叶小异。今山中又有一种甚相似，茎方，叶小强，不甚香。既云山中者为非，而药家乃采用之。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170638-aehmzat","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170638-aehmzat","updated":"20240611170638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔谨案〕泽兰，茎方，节紫色，叶似兰草而不香，今京下用之者，是。陶云都梁香，乃兰草尔，俗名兰香，煮以洗浴，亦生泽畔，人家种之，花白，紫萼茎圆，殊非泽兰也。陶注兰草，复云名都梁香，并不深识也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170556-opjnplx","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611170556-opjnplx"}},{"ID":"20240611170557-j28va2w","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611170557-j28va2w","updated":"20240611170605"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"泽兰《本草图经》"}]},{"ID":"20240611170557-hgogrel","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170557-hgogrel","updated":"20240611170601"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"泽兰"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，生汝南诸大泽旁，今荆、徐、随、寿、蜀、梧州、河中府皆有之。根紫黑色，如粟根；二月生苗，高二、三尺；茎秆青紫色，作四棱；叶生相对，如薄荷，微香；七月开花，带紫白色，萼通紫色，亦似薄荷花。三月采苗，阴干。荆湖、岭南人家多种之。寿州出者无花子．此与兰草大抵相类，但兰草生水旁，叶光润，阴小紫，五、六月盛。而泽兰生水泽中，及下湿地，叶尖，微有毛，不光润，方茎紫节，七月、八月初采，微辛，此为异耳。今妇人方中最急用也。又有一种马兰，生水泽旁，颇似泽兰，而气臭味辛，亦主破血，补金创，断下血。陈藏器以为《楚辞》所喻恶草即是也，北人呼为紫菊，以其花似菊也。又有一种山兰，生山侧，似刘寄奴，叶无桠，不对生，花心微黄赤，亦能破血，皆可用。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170522-pccw0ul","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611170522-pccw0ul"}},{"ID":"20240611170546-xr8n0f1","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611170546-xr8n0f1","updated":"20240611170626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"泽兰《本草纲目》"}]},{"ID":"20240611170546-b7fn5vi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170546-b7fn5vi","updated":"20240611170546"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「释名」水香、都梁香、虎兰、虎蒲、龙枣、孩儿菊、风药。根名地笋。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170546-8mrp8wy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170546-8mrp8wy","updated":"20240611170546"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「气味」（叶）苦、微温、无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170546-htuzhwm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170546-htuzhwm","updated":"20240611170546"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「主治」"}]},{"ID":"20240611170546-cpo72a5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170546-cpo72a5","updated":"20240611170546"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、产后水肿，血虚浮肿。有泽兰、防己，等分为末。每服二钱，醋酒送下。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170546-w34he0i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170546-w34he0i","updated":"20240611170546"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、小儿蓐疮。由大人嚼泽兰心把疮周围封起来。很有效。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170546-q17qf4a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170546-q17qf4a","updated":"20240611170546"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、疮肿初起。把泽兰捣烂封住，有效。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170546-kzwb7i2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170546-kzwb7i2","updated":"20240611170546"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、损伤瘀肿。治法同上。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170546-fu1qc12","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170546-fu1qc12","updated":"20240611170546"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、产后阴翻（产后阴户燥热，变成翻花状）。用泽兰四两，煎汤熏洗。二、三次后，再加枯矾一起煎洗。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170523-5xk5v8f","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611170523-5xk5v8f"}},{"ID":"20240611170534-84p2svq","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611170534-84p2svq","updated":"20240611170539"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"泽兰《本草备要》"}]},{"ID":"20240611170534-i972pc8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170534-i972pc8","updated":"20240611170534"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"通、行血，消水"}]},{"ID":"20240611170534-k7uul7n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170534-k7uul7n","updated":"20240611170534"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苦泄热，甘和血，辛散郁，香舒脾。入足太阴、厥阴（脾、肝）。通九窍，利关节，养血气，长肌肉，破宿血，调月经，消症瘕，散水肿（防己为使）。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170534-b8zke9z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170534-b8zke9z","updated":"20240611170534"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"治产后血沥腰痛（瘀行未尽），吐血鼻血，目痛头风，痈毒扑损。补而不滞，行而不峻，为女科要药（古方泽兰丸甚多）。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170534-snmo7a0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170534-snmo7a0","updated":"20240611170534"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"时珍曰∶兰草、泽兰，一类二种，俱生下湿。紫茎素枝，赤节绿叶，叶对节生，有细齿。但以茎圆节长、叶光有歧者为兰草；茎微方节短、叶有毛者为泽兰。嫩时并可 （音那）"}]},{"ID":"20240611170534-05iyhvw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170534-05iyhvw","updated":"20240611170534"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"而佩之，《楚辞》所谓纫秋兰以为佩是也（朱文公《离骚辨证》云∶必花叶俱香，燥湿不变，方可刈佩。今之兰蕙，花虽香而叶无气，质弱易萎，不可刈佩），吴人呼为香草，俗名孩儿菊（夏日采，置发中，则发不 ，浸油涂发，去垢香泽，故名泽兰）。兰草走气分，故能利水道，除痰癖，杀蛊辟恶，而为消渴良药（经曰∶数食肥甘，传为消渴，治之以兰，除陈气也）。泽兰走血分，故能消水肿，涂痈毒，破瘀除症，而为妇人要药。以为今之山兰者误矣。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170534-9yix8jr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170534-9yix8jr","updated":"20240611170534"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"防己为使（寇宗 、朱丹溪并以兰草为山兰之叶，李时珍考众说以讥之。按别本云∶兰叶甘寒，清肺开胃，消痰利水，解郁调经，闽产者力胜。闽产为胜，则是建兰矣。李士材云∶兰叶禀金水之气，故入肺脏，东垣方中尝用之。《内经》所谓治之以兰除陈气者是也，余屡验之。李时珍又谓东垣所用乃兰草也。其集诸家之言曰∶陈遁斋《闲览》云楚骚之兰，或以为都梁香，或以为泽兰，或以为猗兰，当以泽兰为正，今之所种如麦门冬者名幽兰，非真兰也，故陈止斋着盗兰说以讥之。既名幽兰，正合骚经矣。方虚谷《订兰说》言古之兰草即今之千金草，俗名孩儿菊者；今之所谓兰，其叶如茅者，根名土续断，因花馥郁，故得兰名。杨升庵曰∶世以如蒲萱者为兰，九畹之受诬也久矣。又吴草庐《有兰说》曰∶兰为医经上品，有根有茎，草之植者也。今所谓兰无枝无茎，因黄山谷称之，世遂谬指为离骚之兰。寇氏本草溺于流俗，反疑归说为非。夫医经为实用岂可诬哉？今之兰果可以利水杀虫而除痰癖乎？其种盛于闽，朱子闽人，岂不识其土产而辨析若此。世俗至今，犹以非兰为兰，何其惑之甚也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170534-mnvxhiy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170534-mnvxhiy","updated":"20240611170534"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"昂按∶朱子辨兰，援《离骚》纫 以为证，窃谓纫 亦骚人风致之词耳。如所云饮木兰之坠露，餐秋菊之落英，岂真露可饮而英可餐乎？又云制芰荷以为衣，集芙蓉以为裳，岂真芰荷可衣芙蓉可裳乎？宋儒释经执泥，恐未可为定论也。第骚经既言秋兰，则非春兰明矣。本经既言泽兰，则非山兰明矣。是《离骚》之秋兰，当属本经之泽兰无疑也。然《离骚》不尝曰春兰兮秋菊乎？不又曰结幽兰而延伫乎？不又曰疏石兰以为芳乎？若秋兰既属之泽兰，将所谓春兰幽兰石兰者，又不得为山兰，当是何等之兰乎？且山兰为花中最上之品，古今评者，列之梅、菊之前今反屈，于孩儿菊之下，以为盗袭其名，世间至贱之草皆收入本草，独山兰清芬佳品，摈弃不录，何其不幸若斯之甚也！本草杀虫之药良多，皆未必有验，至于行水消痰，固山兰之叶力所优为者也。盖李时珍、陈、方、吴、杨辈，皆泥定陈藏器以泽兰、兰草为一类二种，遂并骚经而疑之。崇泽兰而黜山兰，遂令兰草无复有用之者。不思若以为一类，则《本经》兰草一条，已属重出，何以《本经》兰草反列之上品，而泽兰止为中品乎？况一入气分，一入血分，迥然不同也。又骚经言兰者凡五，除木兰人所共识，其余春兰、秋兰、幽兰、石兰若皆以为孩儿菊，是不特一类二种，且四种一类矣。而以为九畹之受诬，岂理也哉？盖《本经》言泽兰，所以别乎山也；言兰草，明用叶而不用其花也；骚经言秋兰，所以别乎春也；言石兰，所以别乎泽也。愚谓秋兰当属泽兰，而春兰、石兰定是山兰。其曰幽兰，则山兰之别名，以其生于深山穷谷故也。寇氏、朱氏之论，又安可全非也，姑附愚说，以咨多识之士）。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170523-4qgacq9","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611170523-4qgacq9"}},{"ID":"20240611170524-9f3m55q","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611170524-9f3m55q","updated":"20240611170527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"泽兰《本草分经》"}]},{"ID":"20240611170524-jrmzc89","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170524-jrmzc89","updated":"20240611170524"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苦甘辛香，微温而性和缓，入肝脾血分而行血，独入血海，攻击稽留，通经破瘀，散郁舒脾。省头草气香味辛性凉，入气分，调气生血养营，利水除痰治消渴，经所谓兰除陈气者此也。马兰辛凉，功同泽兰，入阳明血分。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170303-mi5bfma","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611170303-mi5bfma"}},{"ID":"20240611170455-h91kyxo","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611170455-h91kyxo","updated":"20240611170502"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"泽兰《千金翼方》"}]},{"ID":"20240611170455-2fqbul9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170455-2fqbul9","updated":"20240611170455"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦甘，微温，无毒。主乳妇内衄，中风余疾，大腹水肿，身面四肢浮肿，骨节金疮痈肿疮脓，产后金疮内塞。一名虎兰，一名龙枣，一名虎蒲。生汝南诸大泽旁，三月日采，阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170303-cw8f9nm","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611170303-cw8f9nm"}},{"ID":"20240611170442-mnuv7cc","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611170442-mnuv7cc","updated":"20240611170450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"泽兰《本草便读》"}]},{"ID":"20240611170442-1lx1mi6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170442-1lx1mi6","updated":"20240611170442"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"辛香无毒．甘苦微温．行水消瘀．入肝脾而解散．除风逐湿．行经络以分消．若夫另有佩兰．开郁功多．能省头中垢腻．且可宣除陈腐．辛香较胜．堪医脾病消瘅．（泽兰生泽旁．其叶如兰而香．苦辛而温．入肝脾二经消瘀行水．以其温而带甘．故不伤正气．妇人多用之．治血化为水之证．尤为入彀．治风者亦血行风自灭耳．况兼味辛而为叶者乎．佩兰一名省头草．辛平气香．入肺脾肝三经．功用相似泽兰．而辛香之气过之．故能解郁散结．杀蛊毒．除陈腐．濯垢腻．辟邪气．至于行水消瘀之效．二物亦相仿耳．但泽兰治水之性为优．佩兰理气之功为胜．又为异也．）"}]},{"ID":"20240611170303-tlioo2h","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611170303-tlioo2h"}},{"ID":"20240611170311-jaaq5ta","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-jaaq5ta","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中国药典》：泽兰"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-hrjc6mk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-hrjc6mk","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-335rm07","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-335rm07","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Zé Lán"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-5fvby99","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-5fvby99","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-1rbyhyc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-1rbyhyc","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 地瓜儿苗、地笋、甘露子、方梗泽兰"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-08phi84","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-08phi84","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-ol1l0ip","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-ol1l0ip","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" HERBA LYCOPI"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-uk2ftol","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-uk2ftol","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-idk4atf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-idk4atf","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 本品为唇形科植物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"毛叶地瓜儿苗"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Lycopus lucidus Turcz. var.hirtus Regel的干燥"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"地上部分"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。夏、秋季茎叶茂盛时采割，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-dyk5pwq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-dyk5pwq","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-cvkk3y0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-cvkk3y0","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 本品茎呈方柱形，少分枝，四面均有浅纵沟，长50～100cm,直径0.2～0.6cm。表面黄绿色或带绿色，节处紫色明显，有白色茸毛；质脆，断面黄白色，髓部中空。叶对生，有短柄；叶片多皱缩，展平后呈披针形或长圆形，长5～10cm；上表面黑绿色，下表面灰绿色，密具腺点，两面均有短毛；先端尖，边缘有锯齿。花簇生叶腋成轮状，花冠多脱落，苞片及花萼宿存，黄褐色。无臭，味淡。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-xhpqdq8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-xhpqdq8","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"贮藏"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-ku276mj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-ku276mj","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 置通风干燥处。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-ue79trv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-ue79trv","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-nms5so9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-nms5so9","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 除去杂质，略洗，润透，切段，干燥。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-iqn4ton","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-iqn4ton","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-q91gjyf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-q91gjyf","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 归肝、脾经。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-5b5cuiu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-5b5cuiu","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-hkaqfbm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-hkaqfbm","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 苦、辛，微温。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-wvwkzh2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-wvwkzh2","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-5l8pq94","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-5l8pq94","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 活血化瘀，行水消肿。用于月经不调，经闭，痛经，产后瘀血腹痛，水肿。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-iqeosd8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-iqeosd8","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-p4zdtxd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-p4zdtxd","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 6～12g。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-q97zmcm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-q97zmcm","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-amogy66","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-amogy66","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-zoaxnw0","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-zoaxnw0","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中药大辞典》：泽兰"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-9uwirqq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-9uwirqq","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-ayb6kgc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-ayb6kgc","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Zé Lán"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-8jtk73n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-8jtk73n","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-w151vyn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-w151vyn","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 虎兰、龙枣（《本经》），虎蒲（《别录》），小泽兰（《雷公炮炙论》），地瓜儿苗（《教荒本草》），红梗草（《滇南本草》），风药（《纲目》），奶孩儿（《纲目拾遗》），蛇王草、蛇王菊、捕斗蛇草（《岭南采药录》），接古草（《植物名汇》），地环秧、地溜秧（《河北药材》），甘露秧（《中药材手册》），草泽兰（《陕西中药志》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-v3q4cvp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-v3q4cvp","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-9kpa60i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-9kpa60i","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本经》"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-gsll7ai","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-gsll7ai","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-v1syz9o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-v1syz9o","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为唇形科植物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"地瓜儿苗"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"茎叶"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。夏、秋间茎叶茂盛时，割取全草，去净泥沙，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-9xvwvej","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-9xvwvej","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-tshp4k2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-tshp4k2","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生于山野的低洼地或溪流沿岸的灌木丛及草丛中。分布黑龙江、吉林、辽宁、河北、陕西、贵州、云南、四川等地。全国大部地区均产。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-cy8m359","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-cy8m359","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-wwskhxb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-wwskhxb","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 多年生草本，高40～100厘米。地下根茎横走，稍肥厚，白色。茎直立，方形，有四棱角，中空，表面绿色、紫红色或紫绿色，光滑无毛，仅在节处有毛丛。叶交互对生；披针形，陕披针形至广披针形，长4.5～11厘米，宽8～85毫米，先端长锐尖或渐尖，基部楔形，边缘有租锐锯齿，有时两齿之间尚有细锯齿；近革质，上面略有光泽，无毛，下面密被腺点，无毛或脉上疏生白柔毛；叶柄短或几无柄。轮伞花序腋生，花小，多牧；苞片披针形，边缘有毛；萼钟形，长约4毫米，先端5裂，裂片狭披针形，先端长锐尖；花冠白色，钟形，稍露出于花萼，长4.5～5毫米，外面有腺点，上唇直立，下唇3裂，裂片几相等；能育雄蕊2；子房矩形，4深裂，着生于花盘上，花柱顶端2裂，伸出。小坚果扁平，长约1毫米，暗褐色。花期7～9月。果期9～10月。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-12977kj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-12977kj","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本植物的根茎（地笋）亦供药用，另详专条。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-d140yll","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-d140yll","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-l11d30l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-l11d30l","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 干燥的全草，长30～40厘米。茎四方形，直径2～5毫米，节明显，表面黄褐色或微带紫色，每侧面有一纵沟。质轻脆，易折断，断面中央有白色的髓或中空。叶对生，多皱缩，披针形，边缘有粗锯齿，暗绿色或微带黄色。有的叶腋间簇生小花，成轮状。气无，味淡。以叶多、色绿、不破碎、茎短、质嫩者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-03mvpiw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-03mvpiw","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-dst7j4z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-dst7j4z","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 地瓜儿苗全草含挥发油、葡萄糖甙、鞣质和树脂，还含黄酮甙、酚类、氨基酸、有机酸、皂甙、葡萄糖、半乳糖、泽兰糖、蔗糖、棉子糖、水苏糖、果糖。果实含葡萄糖、半乳糖、泽兰糖、蔗糖、棉子糖、水苏糖。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-ta31gmp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-ta31gmp","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"毛叶地瓜儿苗也含挥发油和鞣质。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-ka0qwt3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-ka0qwt3","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药理作用"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-zzq3inw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-zzq3inw","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 地瓜儿苗全草制剂有强心作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-7xemz8j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-7xemz8j","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-x6hr0mk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-x6hr0mk","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 拣去杂质，除去残根，喷水稍润，切段晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-vxcdfgm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-vxcdfgm","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《雷公炮炙论》：\"泽兰，须细锉之，用绢袋盛悬于屋南畔角上，令干用。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-zsymdwe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-zsymdwe","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-k3w3lr8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-k3w3lr8","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 入肝、脾经。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-szv2ezw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-szv2ezw","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《滇南本草》：\"行肝、脾二经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-s5xbubb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-s5xbubb","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《雷公炮制药性解》：\"入小肠经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-oe16bxz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-oe16bxz","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-fk7cs5f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-fk7cs5f","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 苦辛，微温。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-9mc7xer","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-9mc7xer","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"味苦，微温。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-9k83huk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-9k83huk","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《吴普本草》：\"神农、黄帝、岐伯、桐君：酸，无毒。李氏：温。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-if9yuqu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-if9yuqu","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《别录》：\"甘，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-xi920ze","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-xi920ze","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《药性论》：\"味苦辛。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-akt6s7n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-akt6s7n","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-7wkl8d2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-7wkl8d2","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 无瘀血者慎服。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-13zaktm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-13zaktm","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本草经集注》：\"防己为使。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-h6k81nd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-h6k81nd","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《得配本草》：\"血虚枯秘者禁用。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-zz1dj76","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-zz1dj76","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-qnoij05","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-qnoij05","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 活血，行水。治经闭，症瘕，产后瘀滞腹痛，身面浮肿，跌扑损伤，金疮，痈肿。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-3g92zhr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-3g92zhr","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"主乳妇内衄，中风余疾，大腹水肿，身面四肢浮肿，骨节中水，金疮，痈肿疮脓。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-hioa0u0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-hioa0u0","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《雷公炮炙论》：\"能破血，通久积。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-ng5eh27","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-ng5eh27","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《别录》：\"产后、金疮内塞。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-gu35wd1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-gu35wd1","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《药性论》：\"主产后腹痛，频产血气衰冷成劳，瘦羸，又治通身面目大肿，主妇人血沥腰痛。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-6d44u47","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-6d44u47","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《日华子本草》：\"通九窍，利关脉，养血气，破宿血，消症瘕，产前产后百病，通小肠，长肉生肌，消扑损瘀血，治鼻洪吐血，头风目痛，妇人劳瘦，丈夫面黄。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-yp3htjp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-yp3htjp","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥《医林纂要》：\"补肝泻脾，和气血，利筋脉。主治妇人血分，调经去瘀。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-773t2tw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-773t2tw","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦《岭南采药录》：\"治蛇伤，散毒疮。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-lwy4fqt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-lwy4fqt","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-gt8wopk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-gt8wopk","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，1.5～3钱；或入丸、散。外用：捣敷或煎水熏洗。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-ulxojz8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-ulxojz8","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-x19e071","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-x19e071","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治经候微少，渐渐不通，手足骨肉烦痛，日就羸瘦，渐生潮热，其脉微数：泽兰叶三两，当归、白芍药各一两，甘草半两。上为粗末。每服五钱匕，水二盏，煎至一盏，去滓温服，不以时。（《鸡峰普济方》泽兰汤）"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-pt3wkko","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-pt3wkko","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治经闭腹痛：泽兰、铁刺菱各三钱，马鞭草、益母草各五钱，土牛膝一钱。同煎服。（《浙江民间草药》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-3lt05mi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-3lt05mi","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治产后水肿，血虚浮肿：泽兰、防己等分为末。每服二钱，酸汤下。（《随身备急方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-mkkh886","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-mkkh886","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治产后阴翻，产后阴户燥热，遂成翻花：泽兰四两，煎汤熏洗二、三次，再入枯矾煎洗之。（《濒湖集简方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-84j79v0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-84j79v0","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治小儿褥疮：嚼泽兰心封之。（《子母秘录》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-4mfgps6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-4mfgps6","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥治疮肿初起，及损伤瘀肿：泽兰捣封之。（《濒湖集简方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-7votsh3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-7votsh3","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦治痈疽发背：泽兰全草二至四两，煎服；另取鲜叶一握，调冬蜜捣烂敷贴，日换两次。（《福建民间草药》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-uueaxsn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-uueaxsn","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧治蛇咬伤：泽兰全草二至四两，加水适量煎服；另取叶一握捣烂，敷贴伤口。（《福建民间草药》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-arvuvvh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-arvuvvh","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-wvb6h3z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-wvb6h3z","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①《纲目》：\"兰草走气道，泽兰走血分，虽是一类而功用稍殊，正如赤白茯苓、芍药，补泻皆不同也，...又《荀子》云，泽、芷以养鼻，谓泽兰、白芷之气芳香，通乎肺也。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-29gmq8x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-29gmq8x","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草经巯》：\"泽兰，苦能泄热，甘能和血，酸能入肝，温通营血。佐以益脾土之药，而用防己为之使，则主大腹水肿，身面四肢浮肿，骨节中水气。《日华子》…《药性论》…总其泄热和血，行而带补之能也。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-9h2g0v1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-9h2g0v1","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草通玄》：\"泽兰，芳香悦脾，可以快气，疏利悦肝，可以行血，流行营卫，畅达肤窍，遂为女科上剂。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-cu7wwnj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-cu7wwnj","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《本经逢原》：\"泽兰，专治产后血败、流于腰股，拘挛疼痛，破宿血，消癥瘕，除水肿，身面四肢浮肿。《本经》主金疮痈肿疮脓，皆取散血之功，为产科之要药。更以芎、归、童便佐之，功效胜于益母。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-9uuen6n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-9uuen6n","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《本草求真》：\"泽兰，虽书载有和血舒脾、长养肌肉之妙，然究皆属入脾行水，入肝治血之味，是以九窍能通，关节能利，宿食能破，月经能调。癥瘕能消，水肿能散，产后血淋腰痛能止，吐血、衄血、目痛、风瘫、痈毒、扑损能治。观此，则书所云舒脾和血，不过因其水消血除之意，岂真舒脾和血之味也乎，入补气补血之味同投，则消中有补，不致损真，诚佳品也。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-w189j3e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-w189j3e","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥《本草正义》：\"泽兰，产下湿大泽之旁，本与兰草相似，故主治亦颇相近。《本经》大腹水肿，身面四肢浮肿，骨节中水，皆苦温胜湿之功效，亦即兰草利水道之意。其治金疮痈肿疮脓者，专入血分而行瘀排脓消肿也。惟《本经》所谓乳妇内衄，颇不可解，盖即后世新产通瘀之意。《别录》内塞，当亦以瘀露不通言之。甄权谓治产后腹痛，固苦温行瘀之功，又谓治频产血气衰冷，成劳瘦羸，妇人沥血腰痛，则以温和能利血脉言之。然通利之品，能走未必能守，此当以意逆之，而可知其非虚证久服之药矣。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-d1zhuqd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-d1zhuqd","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"备注"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-uu5gci9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-uu5gci9","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 除上述品种外，少数地区尚以下列同属植物作泽兰入药，如山东有用毛叶地瓜儿苗和台湾地瓜儿苗；吉林用小花地瓜儿苗、狭叶地瓜儿苗和朝鲜地瓜儿苗；新疆则用欧地瓜儿苗"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-k1plmsq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-k1plmsq","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在长江以南各省尚有以菊科泽兰属植物如华泽兰（植物形态参见\"广东土牛膝\"条）、山兰（植物形态参见\"秤杆草\"条）、兰草（植物形态参见\"佩兰\"条）的全草作泽兰使用。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-6wxk855","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-6wxk855","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-h7bm83v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-h7bm83v","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-juonny9","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-juonny9","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中华本草》：泽兰"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-sao0b9w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-sao0b9w","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-os377ml","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-os377ml","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Zé Lán"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-6hw2qho","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-6hw2qho","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-g9wxhe6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-g9wxhe6","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 虎兰、龙枣、水香、小泽兰、虎薄、地瓜儿苗、红梗草、风药、奶孩儿、蛇王草、蛇王菊、捕斗蛇草、接古草、地环秧、甘露秧、矮地瓜儿苗、野麻花"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-f2z8l6e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-f2z8l6e","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-f1j2gwt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-f1j2gwt","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Hiraute Shiny Bugleweek Herb, Herb of Hirsute Shiny Bugleweed"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-dt1sx35","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-dt1sx35","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-hay74bm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-hay74bm","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 出自《神农本草经》。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-ej9rz4h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-ej9rz4h","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《吴普本草》：泽兰，生下地水旁。叶如兰，二月生，香，赤节，四叶相植支节间。三月采。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-yf9sch1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-yf9sch1","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《雷公炮炙论》：凡使泽兰须要别识雄雌，其形不同。大泽兰形叶皆圆，根青黄；小泽兰，叶上斑，根头尖。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-qram9xy","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-qram9xy","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240611170311-qcp5b9l","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-qcp5b9l","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240611170311-eqklqly","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-eqklqly","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陶弘景：泽兰，今处处有，多生下湿地。叶微香，可煎油，或生泽傍，故名泽兰，亦名都梁香，可作浴汤，人家多种之，而叶小异。今山中又有一种甚相似，茎方叶小强，不甚香。既云泽"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-r8no9ki","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-r8no9ki","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-o8m4xg5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-o8m4xg5","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 药材基源：为唇形科植物地笋及毛叶地笋的地上部分。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-5cfbv98","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-5cfbv98","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：1.Lycopus lucidus Turcz.2.Lycopus lucidus Turcz. Var. hirtus Regel"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-z23grgo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-z23grgo","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：根茎繁殖当年，种子繁殖第2年的夏、秋季节，茎叶生长茂盛时采收。割取地上部切段，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-wg2iepl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-wg2iepl","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-wtu50gw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-wtu50gw","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生态环境：生于海拔2100m以下的沼泽地、山野低洼地、水边等潮湿处。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-ze0ljmb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-ze0ljmb","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生于沼泽地、水边等潮湿处。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-oj1pe7w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-oj1pe7w","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：分布于东北、华北、西南及陕西、甘肃等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-etfpznr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-etfpznr","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"分布于全国大部分地区。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-ju2joox","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-ju2joox","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-nkgdhiz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-nkgdhiz","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 多年生草本，高可达1.7m。具多节的圆柱状地下横走根茎，其节上有鳞片和须根。茎直立，不分枝，四棱形，节上多呈紫红色，无毛或在节上有毛丛。叶交互对生，具极短柄或无柄；茎下部叶多脱落，上部叶椭圆形，狭长圆形或呈披针形，长5-10cm，宽1.5-4cm，先端渐尖，基部渐狭呈枯形，边缘具不整齐的粗锐锯齿，表面暗绿色，无毛，略有光泽，下面具凹陷的腺点，无毛工脉上疏生白以柔毛。轮伞花序多花，腋生；小苞片卵状披针形，先端刺尖，较花萼短或近等长，被柔毛；花萼钟形，长约4mm，两面无毛，4-6裂，裂片狭三角形，先端芒刺状；花冠钟形白色，长4.5-5mm，外面无毛，有黄色发亮的腺 点，上、下唇近等长，上唇先端微凹，下唇3裂，中裂片较大，近圆形，2侧裂片稍短小；前对能育雄蕊2，超出于花冠，药室略叉开，后对雄蕊退化，仅花丝残存或有时全部消失，有时4枚雄蕊全部退化，仅有花丝、花药的残良；子房长圆形，4深裂，着生于花盘上，花柱伸出于花冠外，无毛，柱头2裂不均等，扁平。小坚果扁平，倒卵状三棱形，长1-1.5mm，暗褐色。花期6-9月，果期8-10月。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-wychedd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-wychedd","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本变种与正种不同处在于：茎棱上被白色向上小硬毛，节上密集硬毛；叶披针形，暗绿色，两商渐尖，上面密被细刚毛状硬毛，下面主要在肋及脉上被刚毛状硬毛，边缘具锐齿，并有缘毛。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-6jt96x6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-6jt96x6","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"栽培"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-vhzenbm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-vhzenbm","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生物学特性 喜温暖湿润气候。在6、7月高温多雨季节生长旺盛。耐寒，不怕水涝，喜肥，在土壤肥沃地区生长茂盛，以选向阳、土层深厚、富含腐殖质的壤土或砂壤土栽培为宜；不宜在干燥、贫瘠和无灌溉条件下栽培。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-h75k4y6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-h75k4y6","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"栽培技术 用根茎或种子繁殖。生产上以根茎繁殖为主。根茎繁殖：在采挖根茎时，选色白、粗壮、幼嫩的根茎，切成10-15cm长小段，按行距30-45cm，株距15-20cm，立即栽种，每穴栽2-3段，覆土厚5cm，稍镇压后浇水。冬种的于次年春出苗，春种10d左右出苗。每1hm2用种量750-900kg。种子繁殖：种子采收后，于3-4月间条播，行距30cm，播后覆土，稍加镇压。种子发芽率50%-60%。土壤温度在17-20℃左右，有足够的温度播种后，约10d左右出苗。每1hm2播种量3.75kg。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-u7k2xpl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-u7k2xpl","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"田间管理 幼勒期注意除草、松土。当苗高30cm，封垄以后，可以不乾地除草，但此时应注意浇水，保持土壤湿润。苗高10-15cm及第1次收割以后，都应进行追肥，施用腐熟人畜粪水，或施用硫酸铵每1hm2 225-300kg。种植2-3年后，植株丛生，应行翻栽。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-1joq8f5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-1joq8f5","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"病虫害防治 病害有锈病，可用敌锈钠200-300倍液，加少许合成洗衣粉，喷雾防治。虫害有尺蠖，6、7月发生，可用90%敌百虫800-1000倍液喷雾。紫苏野螟。幼虫为害叶部，北京于7-9月间出现，防治方法：清园，处理残株，收获后翻耕土地，减少越冬虫源。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-9uzraf9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-9uzraf9","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-mkb7ner","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-mkb7ner","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 性状鉴别 （1）地笋 茎呈方形，四面均有浅纵沟，长50-100cm，直径2-5mm，表面黄绿色或稍带紫色，节明显，节间长2-11cm；质脆，易折断，髓部中空。叶对生，多皱缩，展平后呈披针形或长圆形，边缘有锯齿，上表面黑绿色，下表面灰绿色，有棕色腺点。花簇生于叶腋成轮状，花冠多脱落，苞片及花萼宿存。气微，味淡。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-0d4lfwh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-0d4lfwh","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）毛叶地笋 茎节及叶面上密被硬毛，余均与地笋相似。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-834il7c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-834il7c","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以质嫩、叶多、色绿者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-de9czpd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-de9czpd","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"显微鉴别 （1）地笋 叶表面观；上表皮细胞垂周壁较平直，有少数非腺毛，角质层隐现波状层纹。非腺毛，角质层隐现波状层纹。非腺毛1-5细胞，表面隐现疣状突起，长75-360μm，叶脉上的毛长可达520μm，基部细胞较宽，直径32-80μm，并有少数腺毛，腺头1-2细胞，直径16-28μm，柄单细胞。下表皮细胞垂周壁波状弯曲，腺鳞较多，头部直径55-80μm，6-8细胞，亦有少数单细胞头腺毛，叶脉上非腺毛较多，长80-520μm，表面有疣状突起。气孔直轴式。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-42btssp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-42btssp","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"茎表面观：表皮细胞长方形，角质层有纹理；腺毛头部1-2细胞，柄单细胞；腺鳞头部直径角质层有纹理；腺毛头部1-2细胞，柄单细胞；腺鳞头部直径56-60μm，6-8细胞。气孔稀少。偶见非腺毛。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-airkfxf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-airkfxf","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）毛叶地笋 叶表面观：上表皮细胞垂周壁平直，非腺毛较多，1-5细胞，长45-495μ，基部直径32-50μm，表面有明显的疣状突起，并有腺毛。下表皮细胞壁波状弯曲，腺毛较多，主脉及侧脉上均有众多非腺毛，3-6细胞，长62-600μm；腺鳞头部直径64-72μm。气孔直轴式。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-npmxvit","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-npmxvit","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"茎表面观：表皮细胞多角形或长方形，角质层隐现纹理。有腺毛及腺鳞。单细胞非腺毛长20-28μm，茎的棱处有少数多细胞非腺毛，长可达750μm，表面亦有疣状突起。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-mkg0yrs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-mkg0yrs","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-7bvzd0c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-7bvzd0c","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.葡萄糖（glucose)，半服糖（galactose)，泽兰糖（lycopose)，水苏糖（stachyose)，棉子糖（raffinose)，蔗糖（sucrose)[1，2]，另含虫漆蜡（lacceroic acid)，白桦脂酸（betulinic acid)，熊果酸（ursolic acid)，β-谷甾醇[3]。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-udu64ye","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-udu64ye","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.毛叶地笋 全草含挥发油和鞣质[4]。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-ck6tbdv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-ck6tbdv","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药理作用"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-tq805gd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-tq805gd","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 地瓜儿苗全草制剂有强心作用。两种泽兰，地瓜儿苗及毛叶泽兰全草的水浸膏，2g/kg 腹腔注射，均可使模拟航天飞行中失重引起血瘀的兔明显改善微循环障碍，4g/kg 灌胃，连续4g天，对兔异常的血液流变也有较好的改善作用，使血液粘度、纤维蛋白原含量及红细胞聚集指数均低于对照组。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-hhh33w2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-hhh33w2","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-33zan1i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-33zan1i","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 拣去杂质，除去残根，喷水稍润，切段晒干。《雷公炮炙论》：泽兰，须细锉之，用绢袋盛悬于屋南畔角上，令干用。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-6e16mh4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-6e16mh4","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鉴别"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-qvk3ijx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-qvk3ijx","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 理化鉴别 薄层色谱：取本品粗粉100g，置挥发油测定器中进行蒸馏，所得粗挥发油用乙水硫酸钠脱水，回收乙醚得挥发油。取挥发油0.1ml溶于石油醚1ml中作供试品液。另以α-蒎烯作对照品。分别点样于硅胶G-CMC薄板上，用已烷展开，置紫外光灯（365nm）观察，供试品液色谱中，在与对照品色谱相应位置，显相同的色斑。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-z71smbd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-z71smbd","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-tcxcacn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-tcxcacn","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 归肝；脾经"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-xju8xl9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-xju8xl9","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-p0hcee9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-p0hcee9","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 味苦；辛；性微温"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-x2iikyk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-x2iikyk","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-hj1s1rb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-hj1s1rb","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 无瘀血者慎服。《得配本草》：血虚枯秘者禁用。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-u9dopn1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-u9dopn1","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-wbnozzd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-wbnozzd","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 活血化瘀；行水消肿；解毒消痈。主妇女经闭；痛经；产后瘀滞腹痛；症瘕浮肿；跌打损伤；痈肿疮毒"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-7ltenc1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-7ltenc1","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-bpcpqy8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-bpcpqy8","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，6-12g或入丸、散。外用：适量，鲜品捣敷；或煎水熏洗。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-b2kdx35","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-b2kdx35","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-tvqlpzy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-tvqlpzy","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 泽兰汤《鸡峰普济方》；泽兰汤《备急千金要方》；流鼻血方《揣摩有得集》；清魂散《产育宝庆集》"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-048xsdg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-048xsdg","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-7o18q0v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-7o18q0v","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.《纲目》：兰草走气道，泽兰走血分，虽是一类而功用稍殊，正如赤白茯苓、芍药，补泻皆不同也。雷斅言雌者调气生血，雄者破血通积，正合二兰主治。又《荀子》云，泽、芷以养鼻，谓泽兰、白芷之气芳香，通乎肺也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-up3e2ds","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-up3e2ds","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《本草经疏》：泽兰，苦能泄热，甘能和血，酸能入肝，温通营血。佐以益脾土之药，而用防己为之使，则主大腹水肿，身面四肢浮肿，骨节中水气。《日华子》《药性论》总其泄热和血，行而带补之能也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-hsfndfd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-hsfndfd","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《本草通玄》：泽兰，芳香悦脾，可以快气，疏利悦肝，可以行血，流行营卫，畅达肤窍，遂为女科上剂。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-5hlh040","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-5hlh040","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《本经逢原》：泽兰，专治产后血败、流于腰股，拘挛疼痛，破宿血，消症瘕，除水肿，身面四肢浮肿。《本经》主金疮痈肿疮脓，皆取散血之功，为产科主要药。更以芎、归、童便佐之，功效胜于益母。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-uuzp63p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-uuzp63p","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《本草求真》：泽兰，虽书载有和血舒脾、长养肌肉之妙，然究皆属入脾行水，入肝治血之味，是以九窍能通，关节能利，宿食能破，月经能调，症瘕能消，水肿能散，产后血淋腰痛能止，吐血、衄血、目痛、风瘫、痈毒、扑损能治。观此，则书所云舒脾和血，不过因其水消血除之意，岂真舒脾和血之味也乎。入补气补血之味同投，则消中有补，不致损真，诚佳品也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-u3euecx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-u3euecx","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.《本草正义》：泽兰，产下湿大泽之旁，本与兰草相似，故主治亦颇相近。《本经》大腹水肿，身面四肢浮肿，骨节中水，皆苦温胜湿之功效，亦即兰草利水道之意。其治金疮痈肿疮脓者，专入血分而行瘀排脓消肿也。惟《本经》所谓乳妇内衄，颇不可解，盖即后世新产通瘀之意。《别录》内塞，当亦以瘀露不通言之。甄权谓治产后腹痛，固苦温行瘀之功，又谓治频产血气衰冷，成劳瘦赢，妇人沥血腰痛，则以温和能利血脉言之。然通利之品，能走未必能守，此当以意逆之，而可知其非虚证久服之药矣。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-kmfq3me","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-kmfq3me","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.《本经》：主乳妇内衄,中风余疾，大腹水肿，身面四肢浮肿，骨节中水，金疮，痈肿疮脓。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-ucrgpkk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-ucrgpkk","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8.《雷公炮炙论》：能破血，通久积。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-amz13og","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-amz13og","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9.《别录》：产后、金疮内塞。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-8lvki8j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-8lvki8j","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10.《药性论》：主产后腹痛，频产血气衰冷成劳，瘦赢，又治通身面目大肿，主妇人血沥腰痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-x8am0dl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-x8am0dl","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"11.《日华子本草》：通九窍，利关脉，养血气，破宿血，消症瘕，产前产后百病，通小肠，长肉生肌，消扑损瘀血，治鼻洪吐血，头风目痛，妇人劳瘦，丈夫面黄。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-qa36m7u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-qa36m7u","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"12.《医林纂要》：补肝泻脾，和气血，利筋脉。主治妇人血分，调经去瘀。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-taj1hke","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-taj1hke","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"13.《岭南采药录》：治蛇伤，散毒疮。"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-syrztqd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-syrztqd","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240611170311-82fbl97","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170311-82fbl97","updated":"20240611170311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240611170312-s7d94on","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611170312-s7d94on"}},{"ID":"20240611170313-bryfa9s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611170313-bryfa9s"}}]}